        Line("गाड्डी नै भी सांस लेण दे, अर तू भी लस्सी पी कै आराम कर।", "Gaadi nai bhi saans len de, ar tu bhi lassi pi ke aaraam kar.", "Let the car breathe, and you have a lassi and rest."),
        Line("सफर पूरा! शीशे चढ़ा दिए, कोए चीज सीट पै तो ना छूटी?", "Safar poora! Sheeshe chadha diye, koi cheez seat pe to na chhooti?", "Trip done! Roll up the windows. Nothing left on the seat?"),
        Line("चाल लाडले, थारे गेल्यां घणा बढ़िया लाग्या, फेर बुलाइए।", "Chaal laadle, thaare gelyaan ghana badhiya laagya, pher bulaaiye.", "Bye, dear. Loved riding with you. Call me again."),
