        Line("मंजिल आ गी! बोल, कसूत रास्ता बताया के ना?", "Manzil aa gi! Bol, kasoot raasta bataaya ke na?", "We've arrived! Say it, wasn't that a cracking route?"),
        Line("पहुँच गे, ना एक मोड़ छूट्या, ना एक चालान, लठ गाड़ दिए!", "Pahunch ge, na ek mod chhootya, na ek chaalaan, lath gaad diye!", "Arrived: not one missed turn, not one fine. Nailed it!"),
