        Line("ब्रेक हल्का सा दबा ले, लिमिट तै ऊपर सै, घरां चूरमा ठंडा ना होवैगा।", "Brake halka sa daba le, limit te oopar sai, gharaan choorma thanda na hovaiga.", "Touch the brake, you're over the limit. The choorma at home won't go cold."),
