    Event.WeatherFog to listOf(
        Line("आग्गै धुंध सै, धीरे कर अर फॉग लाइट जला ले, दीखै कोनी तो ओवरटेक ना।", "Aaggai dhundh sai, dheere kar ar fog light jala le, deekhai koni to overtake na.", "Fog ahead, slow down and switch on the fog lights. Can't see? Don't overtake."),
